9. FINANCIAL ENGINE — NON-NEGOTIABLE

Financial accuracy is more important than visual effects.

Currency

Default currency: INR (₹).

Use Indian number grouping, such as ₹18,40,000.

Store all monetary values as integer minor units (paise).

Never use JavaScript floating-point numbers for financial storage or calculations.

Use a central pricing, discount and tax service.

Frontend components must display server-calculated financial totals rather than independently calculating authoritative totals.

Calculation order

Document and implement this order consistently:

Base unit price + variant extra.

Multiply by quantity.

Apply eligible discount.

Apply tax.

Calculate line totals.

Aggregate invoice totals.

Calculate paid and outstanding balances.

For tax-exclusive prices, add tax.

For tax-inclusive prices, extract the included tax.

Cap discounts so no line or invoice can become negative.

Use explicit, consistent rounding rules.

Immutable financial snapshots

Confirmed invoices must retain snapshots of:

Product name.

Variant.

Unit price.

Quantity.

Discount.

Tax.

Final amount.

Later product, plan, discount or tax changes must not rewrite historical financial records.

