22. MOTION GRAPHICS AND MICRO-INTERACTION SYSTEM

This is a mandatory design requirement.

Make Brightloop Pulse feel alive, modern and premium through small, tasteful motion graphics.

Motion must improve feedback, hierarchy and user experience. It must never distract from financial information or reduce application performance.

