A. Motion design principles

Use:

Subtle.

Smooth.

Fast.

Purposeful.

Consistent.

Lightweight.

Performance-friendly animation.

Target a smooth 60 FPS experience on supported devices under normal workload.

Prefer GPU-friendly CSS transitions using transform and opacity.

Avoid unnecessary layout recalculation, large animated shadows, expensive blur filters, continuous animation loops and excessive DOM updates.

